","path":"outputs/review_replies/thread_13.md"}

{"content":"# Thread 14 — (round 2) missing trailing newline in the task_ledger fixture

Resolved this round: `test/wire/fixtures/v1/events/task_ledger.json` now ends with a newline, matching every sibling fixture (full `test/wire/` suite green).
","path":"outputs/review_replies/thread_14.md"}

{"content":"# Thread 15 — Agent.finalizeGate docstring describes host wiring that does not exist

Fixed in `lib/src/agent/agent.dart`: the docstring now states what is true today — "only the CLI host flips this today (boot approval mode `unattended`); the builder's `AgentWiringSpec` has no knob for it in v1 — hosts that want the gate must set the field after the stack lands." No more claim that `wireAgentCore` flips it.
","path":"outputs/review_replies/thread_15.md"}

